# Echoes of the Archivist

A former cryptographer known only as The Archivist left behind a collection of encrypted notes before disappearing. 
Most of the archive was corrupted, leaving only a single recovered file.
At first glance the contents seem random, but forensic analysts identified traces of multiple transformation stages. 
Deep within the recovered metadata was a fragmented sentence:

"I symboloseirá 'uppolice' se éna apó ta typiká kryptografiká hashes BOREI NA chrisimopoiitheí os kleidí gia tin anáktisi tis sostís simaías."

Whether this is a clue, a distraction, or part of the encryption process remains unknown.
Recover the original message and obtain the flag.

